<title>USA: US meat production 2.2 pct below week ago - USDA.</title>
<headline>US meat production 2.2 pct below week ago - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, Dec 21 fell 2.2 pct at 809.2 min lbs.-USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2  LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>21-Dec-96	468.6     6.2	 329.7	4.7	809.2</p>
<p>14-Dec-96	476.8     6.2	 339.2	5.4	827.6</p>
<p>Change:	  -1.7%     0.0%	 -2.8%   -13.0%	-2.2%</p>
<p>23-Dec-95	465.0     6.3	 344.4	5.4	821.1</p>
<p>Change:	   0.8%    -1.6%	 -4.3%   -13.0%	-1.4%</p>
<p>1996 YTD:    24429.9   343.9     16392.4    251.6    41417.8</p>
<p>1995 YTD:    24191.3   293.0     17159.7    270.9    41914.9</p>
<p>Change:	   1.0%    17.4%	 -4.5%    -7.1%	-1.2%</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK SLAUGHTER (HEAD)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS     HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>21-Dec-96     685,000	   30,000     1,747,000	73,000</p>
<p>14-Dec-96     697,000	   30,000     1,798,000	85,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -1.7%	     0.0%	   -2.8%	-14.1%</p>
<p>23-Dec-95     654,000	   31,000     1,840,000	87,000</p>
<p>Change:	   4.7%	    -3.2%	   -5.1%	-16.1%</p>
<p>1996 YTD:  34,938,000	1,658,000    88,464,000   3,932,000</p>
<p>1995 YTD:* 34,279,000	1,366,000    92,530,000   4,317,000</p>
<p>Change:	   1.9%	    21.4%	   -4.4%	 -8.9%</p>
<p>*1995 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions  </p>
